/span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Silver%20Amulet\"><img alt=\"Silver Amulet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Silver_Amulet_3589d6.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Horn\"><img alt=\"Minotaur Horn\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minotaur_Horn_980859.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><b>Dusalk's Troll Clan Cave</b> (officially named on the map \"Kazordoon Troll Den\") is located between <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a>, east of the Dwarven Bridge, you need a shovel to open the hole that is hidden behind a tree. This cave includes many <a href=\"#/wiki/Troll\">Trolls</a> so you can hunt here well as a lower <a href=\"#/wiki/Level\">level</a>. But be careful there's a Minotaur Archer and a Minotaur Mage in the lower level of the cave that could be lured, even to the surface.\n</p><p>It also includes a grave with this inscription:<br/>\nYou read: Deraut kadet ul al cadert!<br/>\nHerot kar Gurxat<br/>\n<br/>\nAlso, there you can find <a href=\"#/wiki/Daily%20Respawns\">Daily Respawns</a> of 12 <a href=\"#/wiki/Troll%20Green\">Troll Green</a> and other items, they're located on a small room filled with bugs and bats, west of the entrance.\n</p><p>The <a href=\"#/quest/longsword-quest\">Longsword Quest</a> can be found in this cave.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Floor -1</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bat\"><img alt=\"Bat\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bat_78810b.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Bat\">Bat</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">10</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">30</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">8 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bat%20Wing\">Bat Wing</a> (rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Rat\"><img alt=\"Rat\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rat_df2b53.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Rat\">Rat</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">5</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">20</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"whi